meta {
  name: subir - POST /api/imagenes
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:8080
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/imagenes
  body: multipart-form
  auth: inherit
}

body:form-data {
  datos: {"codigo":"tmp-1","nombre":"foto","tipoPropietario":"PELICULA","codigoPropietario":1}
  file: @file(foto.jpg)
}

docs {
  Requiere auth. Partes: datos (JSON) + file (JPG/PNG/WEBP, max 5MB). Sin file -> 400. PUT /{codigo} reemplaza, POST /{codigo}/restaurar?versionId=, POST /{codigo}/renombrar?nombre=, DELETE ?confirmacion=true. SDK nunca en responses.
}
